WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.705
Meet VideoUltra.

2
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:07.594
A video editor for any React or Next.js app. Here is the raw footage.

3
00:00:08.733 --> 00:00:13.612
VideoUltra turns them into something worth sharing. Trim to the best moments,

4
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:18.248
lift the colour, and add smooth transitions.

5
00:00:22.733 --> 00:00:26.010
Drop in music, and a big animated title.

6
00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:37.480
Need a voiceover? Type it. Captions? One tap.

7
00:00:48.533 --> 00:00:50.892
Then export an MP4, right in the browser.

8
00:00:53.867 --> 00:00:57.333
Before… and after. Made in a minute.

9
00:01:05.367 --> 00:01:07.766
And adding it to your app takes a few lines.

10
00:01:12.367 --> 00:01:15.443
VideoUltra. Free, fast and open source.
